//// onze-content — the HTML5 named character references (front 121).
////
//// The 2125 names of <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/entities.json> that end in
//// `;`, the only form CommonMark recognises (spec 0.31.2 § Entity and numeric
//// character references). Generated from that file; `entityText` answers the
//// text a name stands for, `""` for a name that is not one.

